# 🚀 Autonomous Release Orchestrator

> **Governing Authority:** Governing Officer Tarwater  
> **Control Plane:** Governed under `autonomous-governance-core`

## Overview
`autonomous-release-orchestrator` automates the final delivery pipeline. Upon merging approved Pull Requests to `main`, it analyzes commit history, computes semantic version bumps, compiles structured changelogs, and publishes official GitHub Releases automatically.
